import ../../site/games/farm/controller.dl
import site_fixture.dl

set instance to an instance of website fixture
set driver to a website shader test driver
set view to a new UI view
set view's driver to the address of driver
set view's instance to the address of instance
set state to a new website state
set state's view to the address of view
set state's services to the browser UI service provider
set instance's state to (the address of state) as a pointer
prepare website fixture editors in (the address of state)
initialize the website Farm in (the address of state)
open website Farm document in (the address of state)
set session to the address of (state's farm)
set session's document's world's tick to 37
set role to the website Farm viewed role in (the address of state)
set role's source to "A private draft from the previous profile."
show website Farm role (role's id) in (the address of state)
# A ready scene and a captured pointer are valid immediately before auth changes.
set session's renderer to a website Farm renderer for (session's document's world) in (UI box at 0.0 0.0 sized 640.0 480.0) using shader (77 as a pointer) in (the address of view)
set session's graphics phase to 3
set session's pointer mode to 1
set session's focused to true
set the value of "Challenge views" in (the address of instance) to 2

# The account controller has already selected the new store before notifying games.
set state's progress's document to empty website progress
set state's progress's status to 1
set state's progress's profile to "user:second"
apply website progress to the games in (the address of state)
require condition (state's progress's status = 1) reporting "Cancelling a Farm gesture wrote the previous world into the new profile"
require condition (session's document's world's tick = 0) reporting "The new profile retained the previous Farm world"
require condition ((the website Farm viewed role in (the address of state))'s source = (the string form of (the website farm lumberjack source))) reporting "The new profile retained the previous Farm draft"
require condition ((session's pointer mode = 0) and (session's focused = false)) reporting "A profile switch retained pointer or keyboard capture"
require condition (((the JSON member named "games" in (state's progress's document)) has JSON member named "farm") = false) reporting "Opening another profile invented a saved Farm"

close website Farm in (the address of state)
free state's progress's document
free state's river's coding
release website fixture editors in (the address of state)
close the address of instance
print line "Switching profiles during a captured Farm gesture clears the old world and draft without writing either store."
